flowchart TD
    A[Admin opens /authors] --> B[AdminRoute check client-side]
    B --> C[list + search members]
    C --> D{action}
    D -->|change role| E[PATCH /api/users/:id role]
    D -->|activate/deactivate| F[PATCH /api/users/:id/status]
    E --> G[isAdmin re-verified server-side]
    F --> G
    G -->|deny| H[403]
    G -->|allow| I[update persisted, audit via response]
